      "sourceTextSha256": "5f057999a2542d9a1ade121c81bdcf9e7e533fa16b8fe16f944d117f3a4fa996",
      "text": "Day 5 · Breakfast and transfer to the bus station for the scenic bus journey from Cusco to Puno, with stops at Pikillaqta, the baroque church of Andahuaylillas and the Temple of Wiracocha at Raqchi. Lunch in Sicuani, then the climb to the La Raya pass, at more than 4,300 metres, where the scenery changes dramatically. Arrival in Puno, a port city at more than 3,800 metres on the shores of Lake Titicaca and the departure point for the famous floating islands. Reception and transfer to the hotel.",
